   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Does the apportionment resulting from Method X in the table below satisfy the quota rule? Why or why not?<br>\n\n<table class=\"unnumbered\" summary=\".\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>State A</th>\n<th>State B</th>\n<th>State C</th>\n<th>State D</th>\n<th>State E</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Standard Quota</b></td>\n<td>1.67</td>\n<td>3.33</td>\n<td>5.00</td>\n<td>6.67</td>\n<td>8.33</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Apportionment Method X</b></td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>7</td>\n<td>9</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n",
